## We initialized our cluster with:
--pod-network-cidr=10.244.0.0/16

## Flannel's default network configuration uses the same CIDR.

## Run on Master:
kubectl apply -f https://github.com/flannel-io/flannel/releases/latest/download/kube-flannel.yml

Check:
kubectl get pods -n kube-flannel

Check nodes:
kubectl get nodes

Expected:
NAME          STATUS   ROLES           AGE
kube-master   Ready    control-plane   10m

The Master should now become Ready once networking is functioning.
